\s1 Israel’s Restoration
\q1 \v 14 \rb Sing for joy|רָנִּי֙\rb*, \rb O Daughter|בַּת־\rb* \rb of Zion|צִיּ֔וֹן\rb*;
\q2 \rb shout aloud|הָרִ֖יעוּ\rb*, \rb O Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb*!
\q1 \rb Be glad|שִׂמְחִ֤י\rb* \rb and rejoice|וְעָלְזִי֙\rb* \rb with all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb your heart|לֵ֔ב\rb*,
\q2 \rb O Daughter|בַּ֖ת\rb* \rb of Jerusalem|יְרוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb*!
\q1 \v 15 \rb The LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb has taken away|הֵסִ֤יר\rb* \rb your punishment|מִשְׁפָּטַ֔יִךְ\rb*;
\q2 \rb He has turned back|פִּנָּ֖ה\rb* \rb your enemy|אֹֽיְבֵ֑ךְ\rb*.
\q1 \rb Israel’s|יִשְׂרָאֵ֤ל׀\rb* \rb King|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb*, \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb*, \rb is among you|בְּקִרְבֵּ֔ךְ\rb*;
\q2 \rb no|לֹא־\rb* \rb longer|עֽוֹד׃\rb* \rb will you fear|תִֽירְאִ֥י\rb* \rb any harm|רָ֖ע\rb*.
\q1 \v 16 \rb On that|הַה֔וּא\rb* \rb day|בַּיּ֣וֹם\rb* \rb they will say|יֵאָמֵ֥ר\rb* \rb to Jerusalem|לִירֽוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb*:
\q2 “\rb Do not|אַל־\rb* \rb fear|תִּירָ֑אִי\rb*, \rb O Zion|צִיּ֖וֹן\rb*;
\q2 \rb do not|אַל־\rb* \rb let your hands|יָדָֽיִךְ׃\rb* \rb fall limp|יִרְפּ֥וּ\rb*.
\q1 \v 17 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֧ה\rb* \rb your God|אֱלֹהַ֛יִךְ\rb* \rb is among you|בְּקִרְבֵּ֖ך\rb*;
\q2 \rb He is mighty|גִּבּ֣וֹר\rb* \rb to save|יוֹשִׁ֑יעַ\rb*.
\q1 \rb He will rejoice|יָשִׂ֨ישׂ\rb* \rb over you|עָלַ֜יִךְ\rb* \rb with gladness|בְּשִׂמְחָ֗ה\rb*;
\q2 \rb He will quiet you|יַחֲרִישׁ֙\rb* \rb with His love|בְּאַ֣הֲבָת֔וֹ\rb*;\f + \fr 3:17 \ft Or \fqa He will be silent in His love\ft ; LXX and Syriac \fqa He will renew you with His love\f*
\q2 \rb He will rejoice|יָגִ֥יל\rb* \rb over you|עָלַ֖יִךְ\rb* \rb with singing|בְּרִנָּֽה׃\rb*.”
\b 
\q1 \v 18 “\rb I will gather|אָסַ֖פְתִּי\rb* \rb those among you|מִמֵּ֣ךְ\rb* \rb who grieve|נוּגֵ֧י\rb*
\q2 \rb over the appointed feasts|מִמּוֹעֵ֛ד\rb*,
\q2 \rb so that|הָי֑וּ\rb* \rb you will no longer suffer|מַשְׂאֵ֥ת\rb* \rb reproach|חֶרְפָּֽה׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 19 \rb Behold|הִנְנִ֥י\rb*, \rb at that|הַהִ֑יא\rb* \rb time|בָּעֵ֣ת\rb*,
\q2 \rb I will deal|עֹשֶׂ֛ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb with all|כָּל־\rb* \rb who afflict you|מְעַנַּ֖יִךְ\rb*.
\q1 \rb I will save|וְהוֹשַׁעְתִּ֣י\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the lame|הַצֹּלֵעָ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and gather|אֲקַבֵּ֔ץ\rb* \rb the scattered|וְהַנִּדָּחָה֙\rb*;
\q1 \rb and I will appoint|וְשַׂמְתִּים֙\rb* \rb praise|לִתְהִלָּ֣ה\rb* \rb and fame|וּלְשֵׁ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb for the disgraced|בָּשְׁתָּֽם׃\rb* \rb throughout|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb the earth|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb*.
\q1 \v 20 \rb At that|הַהִיא֙\rb* \rb time|בָּעֵ֤ת\rb* \rb I will bring|אָבִ֣יא\rb* \rb you in|אֶתְכֶ֔ם\rb*;
\q2 \rb yes, at that time|וּבָעֵ֖ת\rb* \rb I will gather|קַבְּצִ֣י\rb* \rb you|אֶתְכֶ֑ם\rb*.
\q1 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I will give|אֶתֵּ֨ן\rb* \rb you|אֶתְכֶ֜ם\rb* \rb fame|לְשֵׁ֣ם\rb* \rb and praise|וְלִתְהִלָּ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb among all|בְּכֹל֙\rb* \rb the peoples|עַמֵּ֣י\rb* \rb of the earth|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb*
\q1 \rb when I restore|בְּשׁוּבִ֧י\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb your captives|שְׁבוּתֵיכֶ֛ם\rb*\f + \fr 3:20 \ft Or \fqa your fortunes\f*
\q2 \rb before your very eyes|לְעֵינֵיכֶ֖ם\rb*,”
\qr \rb says|אָמַ֥ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*.
